<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  {{ template "head" . }}
  <body class="flex min-h-screen flex-col">
    {{ template "header" . }}

    <main class="page-shell">
      <article class="mx-auto w-full max-w-2xl self-center">
        <h1 class="page-title">About the Library</h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-base leading-8 text-[#656762] sm:text-lg">
          The Library of Babel is a short story by Jorge Luis Borges about an
          infinite library containing every possible book. Not just books that
          exist, but every combination of characters that could exist.
        </p>

        <ul class="mt-8 space-y-3 border-l border-[#d1d1ce] pl-6 text-base leading-7 text-[#40433f]">
          <li>Your biography (that hasn't been written yet)</li>
          <li>This exact documentation</li>
          <li>Complete nonsense</li>
          <li>Shakespeare's works</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="mt-10 space-y-2 text-sm text-[#777974]">
          <p>
            Read about
            <a
              href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Library_of_Babel"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener"
              class="text-link"
            >the original story</a>.
          </p>
          <p>
            Read
            <a
              href="https://collinsmuriuki.xyz/building-the-library-of-babel-in-go/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener"
              class="text-link"
            >how this implementation works</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </main>

    {{ template "footer" . }}
  </body>
</html>
